  },
  "notes": "The for-loop filter is `url.pathExtension.lowercased() == \"zip\"` (line 61), so the .meta.json sidecar (extension \"json\") and any non-zip file are excluded by construction, not by name matching. items.sort (lines 93-96) orders by contentModificationDate descending, defaulting missing dates to .distantPast."
